@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User

rectangle "COLORS Web Application" {
  usecase "Log in" as Login
  usecase "Open color page" as OpenColors
  usecase "Search own colors\nby partial name" as SearchColors
  usecase "Add color to own list" as AddColor
  usecase "Log out" as Logout
}

User --> Login
User --> OpenColors
User --> SearchColors
User --> AddColor
User --> Logout

note bottom of OpenColors
The browser uses a cookie to decide whether
to display the color page. The PHP color
endpoints do not validate a server session.
end note

note bottom of AddColor
The API identifies the user's list using
the userId sent by the browser.
end note
@enduml
